{{!
  @template mod_moodleoverflow/mail/rejection_text

  The plain text mail to the author of a rejected post. Every value is printed unescaped with triple braces, as this
  is text, not HTML. Data from output\mail\rejection.

  Context variables required for this template:
  * intro - "Your post in <moodleoverflow> -> <discussion> was rejected."
  * reason - The line with the reason of the reviewer, or null if there is none
  * post - The rejected post without a link, see mail/post_content_text

  Example context (json):
  {
    "intro": "Your post in Lecture Q&A -> Why does my recursive function never stop? was rejected.",
    "reason": "Reason: Please do not post solutions to the exercises.",
    "post": {
      "url": null,
      "by": "by Jacob Brown - Monday, 2 November 2026, 10:15 AM",
      "message": "Here is my solution for exercise 3."
    }
  }
}}
{{{intro}}}
{{#reason}}
{{{reason}}}
{{/reason}}

{{#post}}
{{> mod_moodleoverflow/mail/post_content_text}}
{{/post}}
